GOLD LAYER DATA CATALOGUE: gold.vw_customer_credit_profile

1. ARCHITECTURAL OVERVIEW & METADATA

Database Object: gold.vw_customer_credit_profile
Object Type: Virtual Database View (Denormalized Analytical Base Table / Customer 360 Feature Store)
Data Grain: One unique row per loan applicant (customer_id), totaling 307,511 distinct records
Primary Purpose: Consolidates core demographics, declared income, external bureau debt, revolving credit card usage, POS/cash loan balances, and historical installment discipline into a single flat feature matrix
Null Handling Policy: All aggregated historical metrics use ISNULL(..., 0) so thin-file borrowers default cleanly to 0 rather than NULL

2. COLUMN-BY-COLUMN DATA DICTIONARY

A. Customer Identifiers & Core Demographics

1. customer_id
Source: hc_application_train.SK_ID_CURR
Data Type: INT
Definition: Unique primary identifier assigned to each loan applicant.
Example Values: 100002, 100003, 456255
2. default_flag
Source: hc_application_train.TARGET
Data Type: INT
Definition: Target risk indicator: 1 = client experienced payment difficulties, 0 = loan repaid normally.
Example Values: 0, 1
3. contract_type
Source: hc_application_train.NAME_CONTRACT_TYPE
Data Type: VARCHAR
Definition: Category of the loan product requested by the applicant.
Example Values: 'Cash loans', 'Revolving loans'
4. customer_gender
Source: hc_application_train.CODE_GENDER
Data Type: VARCHAR
Definition: Biological/declared gender of the applicant.
Example Values: 'M', 'F', 'XNA'
5. total_income
Source: hc_application_train.AMT_INCOME_TOTAL
Data Type: DECIMAL(18,2)
Definition: Total annual/declared income of the applicant.
Example Values: 202500.00, 135000.00
6. credit_amount
Source: hc_application_train.AMT_CREDIT
Data Type: DECIMAL(18,2)
Definition: Total principal credit amount approved/requested for the current loan.
Example Values: 406597.50, 1293502.50
7. loan_annuity
Source: hc_application_train.AMT_ANNUITY
Data Type: DECIMAL(18,2)
Definition: Scheduled periodic loan installment payment amount.
Example Values: 24700.50, 35698.50
8. goods_price
Source: hc_application_train.AMT_GOODS_PRICE
Data Type: DECIMAL(18,2)
Definition: Retail price of the consumer goods financed by the loan (POS/consumer loans).
Example Values: 351000.00, 1129500.00
9. income_type
Source: hc_application_train.NAME_INCOME_TYPE
Data Type: VARCHAR
Definition: Primary employment or income classification of the borrower.
Example Values: 'Working', 'Commercial associate', 'Pensioner'
10. education_level
Source: hc_application_train.NAME_EDUCATION_TYPE
Data Type: VARCHAR
Definition: Highest formal academic qualification attained by the applicant.
Example Values: 'Secondary / secondary special', 'Higher education'
11. family_status
Source: hc_application_train.NAME_FAMILY_STATUS
Data Type: VARCHAR
Definition: Marital and household status of the client.
Example Values: 'Single / not married', 'Married', 'Widow'
12. housing_type
Source: hc_application_train.NAME_HOUSING_TYPE
Data Type: VARCHAR
Definition: Current residential living arrangement of the applicant.
Example Values: 'House / apartment', 'Rented apartment'
13. customer_age_years
Source: hc_application_train.DAYS_BIRTH
Data Type: DECIMAL(5,2)
Definition: Exact age of the applicant in years at application (ABS(DAYS_BIRTH / -365.25)).
Example Values: 25.90, 45.89, 61.05
14. employment_duration_days
Source: hc_application_train.DAYS_EMPLOYED
Data Type: INT
Definition: Days employed prior to application (negative = active tenure; 365243 = pensioner code).
Example Values: -637, -1188, 365243

B. External Credit Bureau Scoring & Summary Metrics

15. external_score1
Source: hc_application_train.EXT_SOURCE_1
Data Type: FLOAT
Definition: Normalized risk score from external credit data source 1 (0 to 1; higher = lower risk).
Example Values: 0.083037, 0.311267, NULL
16. external_score2
Source: hc_application_train.EXT_SOURCE_2
Data Type: FLOAT
Definition: Normalized risk score from external credit data source 2 (0 to 1).
Example Values: 0.262949, 0.622246, 0.713524
17. external_score3
Source: hc_application_train.EXT_SOURCE_3
Data Type: FLOAT
Definition: Normalized risk score from external credit data source 3 (0 to 1).
Example Values: 0.139376, 0.535276, NULL
18. total_bureau_loans
Source: hc_bureau.SK_ID_BUREAU
Data Type: INT
Definition: Total count of historical and current loans reported to external credit bureaus.
Example Values: 0, 4, 11
19. active_bureau_loans
Source: hc_bureau.CREDIT_ACTIVE
Data Type: INT
Definition: Number of currently open/active credit facilities held with external institutions.
Example Values: 0, 2, 5
20. total_bureau_credit_sum
Source: hc_bureau.AMT_CREDIT_SUM
Data Type: DECIMAL(18,2)
Definition: Cumulative credit limit/principal granted across all external bureau records.
Example Values: 0.00, 865055.56, 3825000.00
21. total_bureau_debt
Source: hc_bureau.AMT_CREDIT_SUM_DEBT
Data Type: DECIMAL(18,2)
Definition: Total current outstanding debt owed across all external credit bureau accounts.
Example Values: 0.00, 245781.00, 1120000.00
22. max_bureau_days_overdue
Source: hc_bureau.CREDIT_DAY_OVERDUE
Data Type: INT
Definition: Maximum days past due recorded on any external credit bureau account at application.
Example Values: 0, 15, 142
23. total_bureau_balance_records
Source: hc_bureau_balance.MONTHS_BALANCE
Data Type: INT
Definition: Total count of monthly historical status snapshots across all external bureau loans.
Example Values: 0, 48, 196
24. total_bureau_delinquent_months
Source: hc_bureau_balance.STATUS
Data Type: INT
Definition: Total historical months flagged as delinquent (1-30, 31-60, 61-90, 91-120, or 120+ DPD).
Example Values: 0, 2, 14

C. Internal Revolving Credit Card & POS/Cash Histories

25. total_credit_card_records
Source: hc_credit_card_balance.SK_ID_PREV
Data Type: INT
Definition: Total number of monthly historical credit card balance snapshots with Home Credit.
Example Values: 0, 24, 96
26. average_card_balance
Source: hc_credit_card_balance.AMT_BALANCE
Data Type: DECIMAL(18,2)
Definition: Mean monthly revolving balance carried across the customer's Home Credit cards.
Example Values: 0.00, 45230.15, 189400.00
27. max_card_credit_limit
Source: hc_credit_card_balance.AMT_CREDIT_LIMIT_ACTUAL
Data Type: DECIMAL(18,2)
Definition: Highest credit card limit extended to the customer during their historical card tenure.
Example Values: 0.00, 90000.00, 450000.00
28. max_card_days_past_due
Source: hc_credit_card_balance.SK_DPD
Data Type: INT
Definition: Worst historical delinquency (maximum days past due) on any Home Credit card account.
Example Values: 0, 7, 65
29. total_pos_cash_records
Source: hc_posh_cash_balance.SK_ID_PREV
Data Type: INT
Definition: Total count of monthly balance snapshots across prior Point-of-Sale (POS) and cash loans.
Example Values: 0, 18, 72
30. average_installments_remaining
Source: hc_posh_cash_balance.CNT_INSTALMENT_FUTURE
Data Type: DECIMAL(10,2)
Definition: Average number of future installments remaining across historical POS/cash snapshots.
Example Values: 0.00, 6.50, 14.25
31. max_pos_cash_days_past_due
Source: hc_posh_cash_balance.SK_DPD
Data Type: INT
Definition: Worst historical delinquency (maximum days past due) recorded across prior POS/cash loans.
Example Values: 0, 12, 94

D. Prior Application Outcomes, Payment Discipline & Audit Metadata

32. total_previous_applications
Source: hc_previous_application.SK_ID_PREV
Data Type: INT
Definition: Total count of prior loan applications submitted by the client to Home Credit.
Example Values: 0, 1, 6
33. approved_previous_applications
Source: hc_previous_application.NAME_CONTRACT_STATUS
Data Type: INT
Definition: Count of previous Home Credit loan applications that were approved.
Example Values: 0, 1, 4
34. refused_previous_applications
Source: hc_previous_application.NAME_CONTRACT_STATUS
Data Type: INT
Definition: Count of previous Home Credit loan applications that were rejected/refused.
Example Values: 0, 1, 3
35. average_previous_credit_amount
Source: hc_previous_application.AMT_CREDIT
Data Type: DECIMAL(18,2)
Definition: Average credit amount approved/requested across all prior Home Credit applications.
Example Values: 0.00, 179055.00, 675000.00
36. total_installments_paid
Source: hc_instalments_payments.SK_ID_PREV
Data Type: INT
Definition: Total count of individual historical loan installment payments recorded for the customer.
Example Values: 0, 19, 145
37. total_underpayment_amount
Source: hc_instalments_payments.AMT_INSTALMENT - AMT_PAYMENT
Data Type: DECIMAL(18,2)
Definition: Cumulative variance between scheduled and actual payments (positive = net underpayment).
Example Values: 0.00, 4500.00, -1250.50
38. maximum_payment_delay_days
Source: hc_instalments_payments.DAYS_ENTRY_PAYMENT - DAYS_INSTALMENT
Data Type: INT
Definition: Maximum days paid late after the scheduled due date (0 or negative = on-time/early).
Example Values: 0, 4, 38
39. gold_view_refresh_date
Source: System Function (GETDATE())
Data Type: DATETIME
Definition: Execution timestamp recording when the Gold layer view was queried or materialized.
Example Values: '2026-11-16 19:09:42.110'
